    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers is delighted to present this well-maintained two-bedroom house to the market. The property is in good condition throughout and boasts bright, spacious rooms. The accommodation includes an entrance hall, a large lounge, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area with patio doors leading to the low-maintenance private courtyard. Upstairs, there are two generously sized bedrooms, master ensuite and each bedroom has fitted carpet and fitted wardrobes, along with a main family bathroom. Ellensborough has always been proven very popular location for purchasers. It is enviably positioned within easy reach of all essential amenities, including primary and secondary schools, leisure and sports facilities, convenience stores. In terms of transport, numerous bus routes are available, and the M50 Motorway is just minutes away by car, providing easy access to all parts of the country. 3 Ellensborough Lodge represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers looking to enter the property market or couples looking to downsize. \r\n\r\nFor more information or to register your interest, please contact Shauna O'Brien at BROE auctioneers today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall                \t    1.63m x 1.55m\tBright entrance hallway to include tiled flooring and \r\nalarm panel. \r\n\r\n\t\r\nLounge                                  5.47m x 3.93m\tSpacious lounge area to include carpet\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tflooring, TV point. Double doors to……\r\n                                          \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room            3.53m x 3.90m\tThere is a great range of floor and eye-level units, \r\nand the area features tiled flooring with patio doors leading to the courtyard.  \r\n\r\nStorage \t\t\t     2.14m x 0.78\tStorage located under the stairs.\r\n\r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t\t     3.92m x 2.68m   To include fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\nEn suite \t\t\t     1.38m x 1.81m \tParty tiled to include WHB, WC and corner shower. \r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t    3.92m x 2.68m     To include fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom \t   \t\t   2.13m x 1.66m     Main bathroom with partly fully tiled walls, WHC, W.C\r\n \t\t\t\t\t\t          and bath. \r\n\r\n\r\nPatio \t\t\t\t4.37m x 4.12m \tA low-maintenance private patio area that faces west.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right 